{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a4b0bbba96b9b03c","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9015-E003\n3\ttitle: Open a run comparison from the Model Registry UI\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9015\n5\tcomponent: Dashboard\n6\tteam: RHOAI Dashboard\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-9015-E001\n11\t- RHAISTRAT-9015-E002\n12\tai_signals:\n13\t  change_specificity: 0\n14\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n15\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n16\t  existing_foundation: 1\n17\t  open_questions: 1\n18\t  external_dependency: 1\n19\t  human_process_gates: 1\n20\t  repo_access: 1\n21\t  architecture_claims: 0\n22\timplementation_type: null\n23\tinvestigation_signals: null\n24\tai_implementability: High\n25\tai_implementability_score: 6\n26\tjira_key: null\n27\tbranch: null\n28\tgated_by: null\n29\tgate_failure_impact: null\n30\t---\n31\t# Open a run comparison from the Model Registry UI\n32\t\n33\t## Description\n34\t\n35\tThis epic delivers the Model Registry side of the comparison workflow in the\n36\tDashboard: from a registered model version in the registry UI, a user can open\n37\tthe run comparison view for the run that produced that version. This lets data\n38\tscientists start a comparison while reviewing registered models, without going\n39\tback to the runs list, using the run lineage recorded on model versions by the\n40\tModel Registry.\n41\t\n42\t## Scope\n43\t\n44\t- In the Dashboard's Model Registry UI, surface the originating run of a\n45\t  registered model version using the run linkage exposed by the Model Registry\n46\t  REST API.\n47\t- Add an action on a registered model version (and/or its registered model)\n48\t  that opens the run comparison view with the linked run preselected, so a\n49\t  comparison can be started directly from the registry.\n50\t- Preselecting a run from the registry composes with the comparison view's\n51\t  existing multi-select behavior (the user adds further runs to compare\n52\t  against).\n53\t\n54\t## Acceptance Criteria\n55\t\n56\t- Given a registered model version that records a link to its originating\n57\t  run, when the user views that version in the Model Registry UI, then the\n58\t  originating run is visible/resolvable from the version.\n59\t- Given a registered model version with a recorded run link, when the user\n60\t  chooses to open a comparison from the registry, then the comparison view\n61\t  opens with the linked run preselected and ready to compare against other\n62\t  runs.\n63\t- Given a registered model version with no recorded run link, when the user\n64\t  views it in the registry UI, then the comparison entry point degrades\n65\t  gracefully (unavailable or clearly disabled) rather than erroring.\n66\t\n67\t## HLR Traceability\n68\t\n69\t- HLR-2 (P1, UI side): \"a comparison can be opened from the Model Registry\" —\n70\t  the registry entry point half of this HLR is covered by this epic; it\n71\t  depends on the run-linkage data recorded by the Model Registry work and on\n72\t  the comparison view delivered by the Dashboard comparison work.\n73\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-83f88429c00ee526","agent_id":"acb33031be1afd8e3","session_id":"c3fb0098-5383-4e64-92ab-0a85f474b883","uuid":"2230e37e-8a48-4b0a-9257-36291f11e17c","timestamp":"2026-10-21T18:39:19.972Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a4b0bbba96b9b03c","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9015 decomposition"}
