0 |\n74\t| RHAISTRAT-9015-E002 | Record originating run linkage on registered model versions | Implementation | Model Registry | Model Registry | P1 |\n75\t| RHAISTRAT-9015-E003 | Open a run comparison from the Model Registry UI | Implementation | RHOAI Dashboard | Dashboard | P1 |\n76\t| RHAISTRAT-9015-E004 | Document the run comparison workflow | Implementation (docs-authoring) | RHOAI Documentation | Documentation | P1 |\n77\t\n78\tEpic count: 4 (main plan, no branch epics).\n79\t\n80\t## Dependency DAG\n81\t\n82\t```mermaid\n83\tgraph TD\n84\t    E001[RHAISTRAT-9015-E001<br/>Dashboard comparison view + diff]\n85\t    E002[RHAISTRAT-9015-E002<br/>Model Registry run lineage]\n86\t    E003[RHAISTRAT-9015-E003<br/>Registry comparison entry point]\n87\t    E004[RHAISTRAT-9015-E004<br/>Comparison workflow docs]\n88\t    E001 --> E003\n89\t    E002 --> E003\n90\t    E001 --> E004\n91\t    E002 --> E004\n92\t    E003 --> E004\n93\t```\n94\t\n95\tCritical path: E001 → E003 → E004 (3 epics).\n96\t\n97\t## DAG Justification\n98\t\n99\t| Edge | Rule | Rationale |\n100\t|------|------|-----------|\n101\t| E001 ∥ E002 (no edge) | Rule 14 | Different repos (odh-dashboard vs model-registry), no shared artifacts — parallel |\n102\t| E001 → E003 | Rule 13 | The registry entry point opens the comparison view that the Dashboard comparison epic produces; it builds against that UI surface and its selected-runs handling |\n103\t| E002 → E003 | Rule 13 | The registry entry point consumes the run-linkage data that the Model Registry epic records on model versions; the consuming implementation is serial after the producing one |\n104\t| E001 → E004 | Rule 11 | docs-authoring is blocked by all Implementation epics (docs describe what was built) |\n105\t| E002 → E004 | Rule 11 | Same |\n106\t| E003 → E004 | Rule 11 | Same |\n107\t\n108\tNo Investigation epics exist, so no gated_by / gate_failure_impact fields and\n109\tno conditional branches apply.\n110\t\n111\t## HLR Traceability Matrix\