docs owner is named anywhere in the strategy — verify before\n144\t   scheduling.\n145\t2. **Data Science Pipelines listed as affected with no described change** —\n146\t   treated as a passive data source (see Step 2 note). If comparing multiple\n147\t   runs turns out to require DSP API changes, that work is currently\n148\t   unrepresented and would need a follow-up epic.\n149\t3. **Docs priority above its HLR** — HLR-4 is P2 but the docs-authoring epic\n150\t   is P1 per the docs priority exception (strategy priority Major). Not a\n151\t   priority inversion in the ordinary sense, but reviewers should be aware\n152\t   the docs epic will sort above HLR-4's stated priority.\n153\t4. **Requirement overlap** — the problem statement notes requirements were\n154\t   consolidated from two customer councils with overlapping wording kept;\n155\t   HLR-1/HLR-3 overlap in particular was resolved by bundling into one epic.\n156\t\n157\t## Tiered Delivery\n158\t\n159\tNot applicable — no external dependencies with uncertain timing. All work is\n160\tin-platform across components that are GA and onboarded.\n161\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b19a76517f11dec9","agent_id":"aa48da2d3651432ab","session_id":"c3fb0098-5383-4e64-92ab-0a85f474b883","uuid":"db1311b8-5a1e-4bcd-b231-eb9fd686ffbe","timestamp":"2026-10-21T18:44:34.780Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-951604ed55b29b62","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9015 decomposition"}
