user adds further runs to compare\n52\t  against).\n53\t\n54\t## Acceptance Criteria\n55\t\n56\t- Given a registered model version that records a link to its originating\n57\t  run, when the user views that version in the Model Registry UI, then the\n58\t  originating run is visible/resolvable from the version.\n59\t- Given a registered model version with a recorded run link, when the user\n60\t  chooses to open a comparison from the registry, then the comparison view\n61\t  opens with the linked run preselected and ready to compare against other\n62\t  runs.\n63\t- Given a registered model version with no recorded run link, when the user\n64\t  views it in the registry UI, then the comparison entry point degrades\n65\t  gracefully (unavailable or clearly disabled) rather than erroring.\n66\t\n67\t## HLR Traceability\n68\t\n69\t- HLR-2 (P1, UI side): \"a comparison can be opened from the Model Registry\" —\n70\t  the registry entry point half of this HLR is covered by this epic; it\n71\t  depends on the run-linkage data recorded by the Model Registry work and on\n72\t  the comparison view delivered by the Dashboard comparison work.\n73\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b19a76517f11dec9","agent_id":"aa48da2d3651432ab","session_id":"c3fb0098-5383-4e64-92ab-0a85f474b883","uuid":"ac0ce369-8b23-4ad9-a088-24cfca7d0abe","timestamp":"2026-10-21T18:44:43.524Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b27c773a3578d181","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9015 decomposition"}
