rrectly using the run data already surfaced by the\n  comparison view.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-3 (P1): run diff view highlighting changed parameters and metrics\n  between two selected runs — fully covered by this epic. This epic extends\n  the run comparison view delivered by the Dashboard comparison work and\n  depends on it.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":29090,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b19a76517f11dec9","agent_id":"aa48da2d3651432ab","session_id":"c3fb0098-5383-4e64-92ab-0a85f474b883","uuid":"9e945207-ceb8-4fd8-b90e-c80b783d78c8","timestamp":"2026-10-21T18:47:03.006Z","subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9015 decomposition"}
